# Window ▸ Open Library… and View Downloads… say what they will do, as Arc's do: Close Library and Hide
# Downloads while the Library shows Downloads; on another page only Open Library… flips, since View
# Downloads… then goes to Downloads. Closed again, both read as before.
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
wait 1
cra://debug?menuRows=Window&label=closed
expect-log menu rows closed: .*\|Open Library…\|View Downloads…\|
cra://action/viewDownloads
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryShown=downloads
expect-log library shown downloads: downloads
cra://debug?menuRows=Window&label=downloads
expect-log menu rows downloads: .*\|Close Library\|Hide Downloads\|
cra://action/viewMedia
wait 1
cra://debug?menuRows=Window&label=media
expect-log menu rows media: .*\|Close Library\|View Downloads…\|
cra://action/viewDownloads
wait 1
cra://action/viewDownloads
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryShown=closed
expect-log library shown closed: closed
cra://debug?menuRows=Window&label=again
expect-log menu rows again: .*\|Open Library…\|View Downloads…\|
